<title>CROATIA: Croatian July PPI falls 0.2 pct, rises 2.0 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Croatian July PPI falls 0.2 pct, rises 2.0 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics</p>
<p>issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA PRODUCER PRICES     JULY	  JUNE	 JULY 96</p>
<p> month-on-month (pct)	  -0.2	  +0.2	   0.0</p>
<p> year-on-year		    +2.0	  +2.1	  +1.7</p>
<p>NOTE-- January-July producer prices rose 2.0 percent compared to the  same period in 1996. -- Zagreb newsroom + 385 1 455 7075</p>
</text>
